// FIXED — the ruling's probe twin: guard at depth 1, TAIL
// recursion. Pre-fix both engines [1,1,1,2]: the framed pass had no
// held state and the tainted guard FELL THROUGH to `_` — a selection
// flip invented from a bottom (a tainted guard is unknown, not
// false). Now the chain stops UNDETERMINED (interp three-valued
// is_match None; kernel undet block — no record, no arm body) and
// the production is the bottom that arrived. Ruled trace both
